------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MedMCP is model-agnostic: it talks to whatever model the local Ollama server
serves and does not redistribute any model weights. The default configuration
(Modelfile.muse) builds on Meta's Muse Glimmer, released under the Apache
License 2.0 — the same licence as MedMCP itself, so the custom "muse-medmcp"
build carries no use restrictions beyond those already in LICENSE:

  - Muse Glimmer:  https://huggingface.co/meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B

Operators who swap in a different model are responsible for complying with that
model's own license and use terms. Some open-weight models — Google's Gemma
among them — ship under bespoke terms carrying attribution and use-restriction
obligations that travel with the model and any derivative of it. Check before
substituting one.

