Container base layers
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The published container images build on third-party base layers, each governed
by its own license:

  - NVIDIA CUDA runtime image (nvidia/cuda:*-runtime-ubuntu24.04), subject to
    the NVIDIA Deep Learning Container license / CUDA EULA.
  - Ubuntu 24.04 and its system packages, under their respective licenses.
  - Ollama (ollama/ollama), MIT License, run as a separate service.

